p><p begin="29.932" end="32.528" lrc:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.932" end="30.319">Too</span> <span begin="30.319" end="30.668">drunk</span> <span begin="30.668" end="30.967">to</span> <span begin="30.967" end="31.151">turn</span> <span begin="31.151" end="31.452">off</span> <span begin="31.452" end="31.700">the</span> <span begin="31.700" end="32.528">light</span></p><p begin="32.749" end="35.113" lrc:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.749" end="33.202">Stay</span> <span begin="33.202" end="33.802">under</span> <span begin="33.802" end="34.002">the</span> <span begin="34.002" end="35.113">covers</span></p><p begin="35.798" end="38.277" lrc:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.798" end="36.233">Who</span> <span begin="36.233" end="36.614">knows</span> <span begin="36.614" end="36.865">how</span> <span begin="36.865" end="37.049">we'll</span> <span begin="37.049" end="37.366">end</span> <span begin="37.366" end="37.649">the</span> <span begin="37.649" end="38.277">night</span></p></div><div begin="38.406" end="50.342" lrc:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="38.406" end="41.445" lrc:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.406" end="38.868">Just</span> <span begin="38.868" end="39.230">don't</span> <span begin="39.230" end="39.564">hang</span> <span begin="39.564" end="39.881">your</span> <span begin="39.881" end="40.657">hopes</span> <span begin="40.657" end="41.033">on</span> <span begin="41.033" end="41.445">me</span></p><p begin="41.822" end="44.353" lrc:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.822" end="42.171">I</span> <span begin="42.171" end="42.489">want</span> <span begin="42.489" end="42.790">to</span> <span begin="42.790" end="43.601">feel</span> <span begin="43.601" end="44.353">something</span></p><p begin="44.353" end="50.342" lrc:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.353" end="44.740">God,</span> <span begin="44.740" end="45.089">you</span> <span begin="45.089" end="45.422">look</span> <span begin="45.422" end="45.791">so</span> <span begin="45.791" end="46.626">pretty</span> <span begin="46.638" end="47.006">when</span> <span begin="47.006" end="47.356">you</span> <span begin="47.356" end="47.772">tell</span> <span begin="47.772" end="48.073">me</span> <span begin="48.073" end="48.356">that</span> <span begin="48.356" end="48.788">you</span> <span begin="48.788" end="49.517">love</span> <span begin="49.521" end="50.342">me</span></p></div><div begin="51.030" end="1:14.330" lrc:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="51.030" end="53.718" lrc:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.030" end="51.822">I</span> <span begin="51.822" end="52.238">wish</span> <span begin="52.238" end="52.555">that</span> <span begin="52.555" end="52.854">I</span> <span begin="52.854" end="53.137">could</span> <span begin="53.137" end="53.718">lie</span></p><p begin="53.964" end="56.762" lrc:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.964" end="54.415">But</span> <span begin="54.415" end="54.783">my</span> <span begin="54.783" end="55.116">mind</span> <span begin="55.116" end="55.465">gets</span> <span begin="55.465" end="55.815">in</span> <span begin="55.815" end="56.081">the</span> <span begin="56.081" end="56.762">way</span></p><p begin="57.014" end="59.565" lrc:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.014" end="57.633">I</span> <span begin="57.633" end="58.030">know</span> <span begin="58.030" end="58.414">you</span> <span begin="58.414" end="58.782">think</span> <span begin="58.782" end="59.049">that</span> <span begin="59.049" end="59.565">I'm</span></p><p begin="59.931" end="1:02.450" lrc:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.931" end="1:00.710">Always</span> <span begin="1:00.710" end="1:01.043">way</span> <span begin="1:01.043" end="1:01.395">too</span> <span begin="1:01.395" end="1:01.827">self</span> <span begin="1:01.827" end="1:02.450">aware</span></p><p begin="1:02.450" end="1:05.869" lrc:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.450" end="1:02.974">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:02.974" end="1:03.291">we</span> <span begin="1:03.291" end="1:03.624">could</span> <span begin="1:03.624" end="1:04.256">never</span> <span begin="1:04.256" end="1:04.691">be</span> <span begin="1:04.691" end="1:05.869">together</span></p><p begin="1:05.869" end="1:08.789" lrc:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.869" end="1:06.213">But</span> <span begin="1:06.213" end="1:06.597">it's</span> <span begin="1:06.597" end="1:06.946">nice</span> <span begin="1:06.946" end="1:07.378">to</span> <span begin="1:07.378" end="1:07.730">play</span> <span begin="1:07.730" end="1:08.789">pretend</span></p><p begin="1:08.844" end="1:11.617" lrc:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.844" end="1:09.641">I</span> <span begin="1:09.641" end="1:09.975">wish</span> <span begin="1:09.975" end="1:10.359">that</span> <span begin="1:10.359" end="1:10.673">I</span> <span begin="1:10.673" end="1:10.991">could</span> <span begin="1:10.991" end="1:11.617">lie</span></p><p begin="1:11.809" end="1:14.330" lrc:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.809" end="1:12.142">But</span> <span begin="1:12.142" end="1:12.444">I'm</span> <span begin="1:12.444" end="1:12.793">way</span> <span begin="1:12.793" end="1:13.126">too</span> <span begin="1:13.126" end="1:13.625">self</span> <span begin="1:13.625" end="1:14.330">aware</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.363" end="1:23.657" lrc:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:14.363" end="1:16.197" lrc:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.363" end="1:14.757">Mood</span> <span begin="1:14.757" end="1:15.077">swings</span> <span begin="1:15.077" end="1:15.293">like</span> <span begin="1:15.293" end="1:15.493">the</span> <span begin="1:15.493" end="1:16.197">weather</span></p><p begin="1:16.225" end="1:17.703" lrc:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.225" end="1:16.709">Body's</span> <span begin="1:16.709" end="1:17.076">under</span> <span begin="1:17.076" end="1:17.703">pressure</span></p><p begin="1:17.703" end="1:20.608" lrc:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.703" end="1:18.008">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:18.008" end="1:18.128">I</span> <span begin="1:18.128" end="1:18.312">love</span> <span begin="1:18.312" end="1:18.514">the</span> <span begin="1:18.514" end="1:18.762">way</span> <span begin="1:18.762" end="1:19.013">you're</span> <span begin="1:19.013" end="1:19.229">using</span> <span begin="1:19.229" end="1:19.546">your</span> <span begin="1:19.546" end="1:20.608">imagination</span></p><p begin="1:20.662" end="1:22.101" lrc:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.662" end="1:20.950">Laws</span> <span begin="1:20.950" end="1:21.217">of</span> <span begin="1:21.217" end="1:22.101">attraction</span></p><p begin="1:22.161" end="1:23.657" lrc:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.161" end="1:22.396">Put</span> <span begin="1:22.396" end="1:22.580">'em</span> <span begin="1:22.580" end="1:22.881">into</span> <span begin="1:22.881" end="1:23.657">practice</span></p></div><div begin="1:25.807" end="1:38.043" lrc:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:25.807" end="1:28.896" lrc:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.807" end="1:26.236">Just</span> <span begin="1:26.236" end="1:26.620">don't</span> <span begin="1:26.620" end="1:26.970">hang</span> <span begin="1:26.970" end="1:27.335">your</span> <span begin="1:27.335" end="1:28.154">hopes</span> <span begin="1:28.154" end="1:28.402">on</span> <span begin="1:28.402" end="1:28.896">me</span></p><p begin="1:29.142" end="1:31.712" lrc:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.142" end="1:29.494">I</span> <span begin="1:29.494" end="1:29.843">want</span> <span begin="1:29.843" end="1:30.177">to</span> <span begin="1:30.177" end="1:30.910">feel</span> <span begin="1:30.910" end="1:31.712">something</span></p><p begin="1:31.793" end="1:38.043" lrc:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.793" end="1:32.179">God,</span> <span begin="1:32.179" end="1:32.545">you</span> <span begin="1:32.545" end="1:32.846">look</span> <span begin="1:32.846" end="1:33.211">so</span> <span begin="1:33.211" end="1